    "localization": {
      "en": {
        "56aafc8e6a57788cbf0378e0": "I cut down the Rogue numbers. Did that change anything?",
        "900cecbdbadf0c939cc86c12": "Didn't expect you to help that much, honestly. Smugglers themselves asked me where the hell that kind of backup came from.",
        "2ee7c8c77259377ba8049036": "So there's a chance now for an easier route to the icebreaker?",
        "2481312032632af6dec646ee": "Don't rush it, man. Right now the Rogues are holding one of the smuggler commanders at their base, and that's a big problem.",
        "fbf9c92d01cfd65c42030736": "You want me to run a solo extraction from their base?",
        "7274025d32056349f368025f": "If anyone tries to storm that place, they'll ice the commander right away. But the guys have a plan.",
        "fe725b51ff57a0abbd8f94c6": "So what do you need from me?",
        "70414f8cb7e4f79d79c9afdb": "Need you to check the route from the nature reserve area to the water treatment plant. If they pull their guy out, they'll remember you helped.",
        "4af2cfd1bd200ed73263ae8c": "So just walk the path from woods to the lighthouse?",
        "9ecf62f1ebdf7518a0f73b42": "Main thing is to make sure the route's clear and nothing unexpected is waiting there. Mark the start and end with IR strobes so they know you actually checked it.",
        "a8812a75b0a971ca261d9346": "Okay. Then go right back to you?",
        "901cf19b317d8718f7e9dff8": "Not while their commander's still breathing. Later.",
        "551eeee80eee1fddddbdc110": "Hold your horses. Better wait until they finish their operation. Do your thing on that ship for now, then come back.",
        "e01f7a0d458db903ef405247": "Still walking the route.",
        "88d8c08fcb8bda3c365f5a04": "Route's marked. Strobes on both ends, and nothing waiting in between.",
        "8a754375ffafb5bb75d5d991": "Passing it on. If they get their man back, you'll have people owing you favours instead of bullets."
      }
    }
  }
]